@startuml
title UML State Chart Diagram

state "Insert Card" as InsertCard
InsertCard : entry / Insert card into ATM
InsertCard : do / Verify card details
InsertCard : exit / Proceed if verified

state "Card Verified" as CardVerified
CardVerified : entry / Valid card inserted
CardVerified : do / Greeting message displayed
CardVerified : exit / Ready for transaction selection

state "Select Predefined Amount" as SelectPredefinedAmount
SelectPredefinedAmount : entry / User selects predefined amount option
SelectPredefinedAmount : do / Display predefined amounts
SelectPredefinedAmount : exit / Amount selected

state "Enter Custom Amount" as EnterCustomAmount
EnterCustomAmount : entry / User selects custom amount option
EnterCustomAmount : do / Input field displayed for custom amount
EnterCustomAmount : exit / Custom amount entered

state "Check Balance" as CheckBalance
CheckBalance : entry / Amount selection complete
CheckBalance : do / Verify sufficient balance
CheckBalance : exit / Proceed if funds are available

state "Dispense Cash" as DispenseCash
DispenseCash : entry / Sufficient balance confirmed
DispenseCash : do / Dispense the requested amount
DispenseCash : exit / Transaction completed

state "Insufficient Funds" as InsufficientFunds
InsufficientFunds : entry / Insufficient balance detected
InsufficientFunds : do / Display error message
InsufficientFunds : exit / Return to previous state

state "Cancel Transaction" as CancelTransaction
CancelTransaction : entry / User chooses to cancel
CancelTransaction : do / Stop transaction process
CancelTransaction : exit / Return card to user

InsertCard --> CardVerified : successful verification

state Choice1 <<choice>>
CardVerified --> Choice1 : [select predefined amount]
CardVerified --> Choice1 : [enter custom amount]

Choice1 --> SelectPredefinedAmount
Choice1 --> EnterCustomAmount

SelectPredefinedAmount --> CheckBalance
EnterCustomAmount --> CheckBalance

CheckBalance --> DispenseCash : sufficient funds
CheckBalance --> InsufficientFunds : insufficient funds

DispenseCash --> [*] : transaction complete
InsufficientFunds --> CardVerified : return to previous state

state Choice2 <<choice>>
SelectPredefinedAmount --> Choice2 : [cancel]
EnterCustomAmount --> Choice2 : [cancel]

Choice2 --> CancelTransaction

CancelTransaction --> InsertCard : return card and end transaction

EnterCustomAmount --> [*] : exit without further action
@enduml
